uations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le05ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "  Comparatives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use the comparative form to compare two things."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The comparative form ends in -er: taller<br /> The word more is used with longer words: <span class=\"italic\">more beautiful</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the comparative with a noun:  <span class=\"italic\">a bigger car, his car was older</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the comparative with than: <span class=\"italic\">his house is larger than my house, this dress is more expensive than that one</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "It's cleaner and newer than I expected. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "It's more beautiful than most Ottoman Mosques!  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The spices are far less expensive here.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "The carpets are cheaper here too!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mosque "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a building for Islamic religious celebrations "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We want to visit the beautiful mosque."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about Istanbul."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bazaar"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an open market where people sell things "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I will go shopping at the bazaar today."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "carpet"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "thick, woven material to cover floors "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I will buy a carpet at the market."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to launch"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to send something out "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The ship is ready to launch."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ruins "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "buildings that are falling down "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Do you want to visit the castle ruins?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le05ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Describe a market you went to sometime in the past."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 6-7 sentences about what you saw there and  bought there."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your sentences to a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to your partner's sentences."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe a market and things in it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write 50 - 75 words about what I saw and bought."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I say my sentences aloud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to my partner speak."}]}], "type": "sena"}